      "text": "upstairs e i omega"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": 369.11,
      "end": 369.12,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "t. Okay, so we're asked to uh compute"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": 369.12,
      "end": 371.51,
      "duration": 2.39,
      "text": "the amplitude response formula or the"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": 371.52,
      "end": 373.67,
      "duration": 2.15,
      "text": "amplitude response graph. And if we take"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": 373.68,
      "end": 376.309,
      "duration": 2.629,
      "text": "a look at this uh we see that the"
